0 REM C64SWEEPER V3 LOADER - HTTPS://M0NDE.ITCH.IO/C64SWEEPER
10 POKE 53280,0:POKE 53281,0
20 IF PEEK(40709)=82 THEN POKE 40709,0:POKE 45,PEEK(174):POKE 46,PEEK(175)
30 REM MEMORY AS HEX64 AND C64DOKU: GAME $4001 (TOP $9000), SCREEN SAVE $2400,
40 REM HELP $2C00, COPY $3400, CHARACTERS $3800, SETTINGS $9F00, MENU $C000
50 POKE 55,0:POKE 56,36-108*(PEEK(44)>63):CLR:DV=PEEK(186):IF DV<8 THEN DV=8
60 IF PEEK(14920)=254 AND PEEK(51200)=160 AND PEEK(11268)=19 THEN 110
